### All books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### Book with reviews
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### Book with a review without text
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/2

### Book without reviews
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/3

### Unknown book (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999

### My shelves
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shelves

### Entries on shelf 3
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shelves/3/entries

### My stats
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stats/me